      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present 54 Railway Avenue, Inchicore, Dublin 8 to the market a charming two-bedroom, one bathroom extended mid terraced home ideally positioned within one of Dublin 8's most established and sought-after residential locations. Railway Avenue enjoys an exceptionally convenient setting with Inchicore Village just a short stroll away, offering a fantastic selection of cafés, restaurants, local shops and everyday amenities. The LUAS Red Line is within easy reach, providing swift access to Dublin City Centre, while the area also benefits from close proximity to St. James's Hospital, the National Children's Hospital and the Phoenix Park, making this an exceptionally well-connected location.\nBright and well-proportioned internal living accommodation spans to c. 56 sqm, and comprises of spacious lounge, kitchen, and family bathroom on the ground floor, while upstairs hosts two bedrooms. No. 54 has been lovingly maintained over the years and now offers the successful purchaser an excellent opportunity to modernise and create a home tailored to their own style and specification. A particular feature of the property is its pleasant outlook to the front, where it is not directly overlooked and instead overlooks a children's playground and green open space, creating a wonderful family-friendly setting.\nWhether you're a first-time buyer looking to step onto the property ladder or an investor seeking a home with excellent potential in a prime Dublin 8 location, No. 54 is sure to impress. Combining character, opportunity and an enviable location, early viewing is highly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today!\nAdditional Features;\n• c. 56 sqm\n• BER D\n• 2 Bed / 1 Bath\n• Mid terraced extended home\n• Gas heating\n• Double glazed windows\n• Fully fitted kitchen\n• Sunny rear garden\n• Not directly overlooked\n• Lovingly maintained\n• Bright and airy\n• Well-proportioned layout throughout\n• Plenty of transport links nearby\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance\n• Highly sought after location\n• Ideal for first time buyers, downsizers, and investors\n• Viewing highly advised!\nDirections;\nEircode: D08 FF9R"
      },
      {
